{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110028008040058880"]}, "author_id": "1483750132957212672", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:21:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110028054659772483"], "id": "2110028054659772483", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🚨 SUPER FLOP FIRST RUN? 🚨\n\n🚆08183 Tatanagar–Buxar Festival Special’s first run reportedly sees 85–90% of seats VACANT! \n\nPoor planning? This train should’ve started just before Diwali and continued until at least a week after Chhath Puja to serve the festive rush &amp; the route https://t.co/XwjpQ66Gza", "url": "https://x.com/RailTatanagar/status/2110028054659772483"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110025676443267072"]}, "author_id": "732361280", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:11:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110025694688485501"], "id": "2110025694688485501", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AMSHEDPUR TRAFFIC ALERT! 🚨 New Durga Puja traffic plan kicks off Oct 15–21! Heavy vehicle 'No Entry', one-way routes in Mango &amp; Sakchi, &amp; designated parking near major pandals. Plan your pandal-hopping wisely! 🚦🏟️ https://t.co/ovrHFJsMtL https://t.co/VGPIoXK6Yo", "url": "https://x.com/debasishc26/status/2110025694688485501"}, {"author_id": "1958811124390141956", "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:09:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110025076422975732"], "id": "2110025076422975732", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1526603809635856384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109684043096965608", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Amit4Films Not possible in one day. Grand pandals like Shreebhumi and Kalyani takes 2-3hrs avg time in queue. You'll be completely exhausted after this.\n\nBut this time Shreebhumi is not that special.\n\nBetter do a pandal hopping in your nearby towns and enjoy with friends partner family.", "url": "https://x.com/SayantikaSays/status/2110025076422975732"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110000784343789568"]}, "author_id": "987325061064544256", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:56:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110021890458968237"], "id": "2110021890458968237", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Durga Puja 2026 : প্রথমবারেই পার্ক স্ট্রিটে পুজো জমজমাট তৃতীয়াতেই অ্যালেন পার্কে চোখে পড়ার মতো ভিড়\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #allenPark #Parkstreet #KolkataPuja #shorts #TheWallNews https://t.co/FatodAvg62", "url": "https://x.com/TheWallTweets/status/2110021890458968237"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110018055254560768"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:44:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110018872158064953"], "id": "2110018872158064953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 636, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: On the party’s protest in Kalighat against Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar, Mamata AITC MLA Sovandeb Chattopadhyay says, \"We did not get into any confrontation. No confrontation took place over there. We took out a rally and went up to Park Circus https://t.co/whN7Wfqslv", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2110018872158064953"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110014556357668864"]}, "author_id": "2456867851", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:27:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110014595729334444"], "id": "2110014595729334444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Get ready for the festive season with the ultimate home glow prep! Packed with natural powerhouses like Kakadu plum for Vitamin C, energizing ginseng, hydrating hyaluronic acid and smoothing papaya, Glamour World Ayurvedic Insta Glow Face Pack turns your home into a mini facial https://t.co/YByruRt5fq", "url": "https://x.com/GWAyurvedic/status/2110014595729334444"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110013701919264768"]}, "author_id": "1563725976504532993", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:24:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110013708848226709"], "id": "2110013708848226709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 156, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Requesting @drmadiwr @WesternRly @GM_ECRly to kindly introduce more special trains between ADI and PNBE during the upcoming Dussehra, Diwali &amp; Chhath Puja festive rush to cater to the expected heavy passenger demand and provide additional connectivity. https://t.co/NNHN2x1dRN", "url": "https://x.com/PatnaRail_/status/2110013708848226709"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110013495182028800", "3_2110013495140143104", "3_2110013495207223297"]}, "author_id": "56312411", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:23:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110013504476663835"], "id": "2110013504476663835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4968, "like_count": 209, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 34}, "text": "Massive &amp; shocking numbers of police at @AITCofficial protest rally in Kolkata today but still a high voltage powerful andolan by TMC’s students and youth. Dear @BJP4India you can barricade the streets but you can’t barricade the spirit of Bengal! https://t.co/gNW6dCZ1ca", "url": "https://x.com/sagarikaghose/status/2110013504476663835"}, {"author_id": "1154791143961317376", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:18:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110012303148245145"], "id": "2110012303148245145", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Kolkata Police deployed over 10,000 officers and 20,000 volunteers across 2,981 Durga Puja pandals, setting up 42 watchtowers, Quick Response Teams, metro station pickets, and river patrols across 15 immersion ghats to ensure smooth crowd management.", "url": "https://x.com/Chotna1/status/2110012303148245145"}, {"author_id": "1154791143961317376", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:18:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110012276950610106"], "id": "2110012276950610106", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#DurgaPuja2026 #Kolkata\nKolkata Police deployed over 10,000 officers and 20,000 volunteers across 2,981 Durga Puja pandals, setting up 42 watchtowers, Quick Response Teams, metro station pickets, and river patrols across 15 immersion ghats to ensure smooth crowd management.", "url": "https://x.com/Chotna1/status/2110012276950610106"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110012019344879616", "3_2110012033861332992", "3_2110012054170128384", "3_2110012069617836032"]}, "author_id": "3412395613", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:17:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110012080845947216"], "id": "2110012080845947216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2246, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "To make pandal-hopping easier and more organised this Durga Puja, Kolkata Police has released the ‘Kolkata Police Puja Guide Map 2026’.\n\nThe guide map will help visitors locate popular puja pandals across the city, plan their puja itinerary and navigate easily from one pandal to https://t.co/9x57rVKshH", "url": "https://x.com/KolkataPolice/status/2110012080845947216"}, {"author_id": "289518570", "created_at": "2026-10-13T14:05:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110009109269696723"], "id": "2110009109269696723", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1067857808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109886444454199313", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Aryan_warlord These people have not seen the 5 lakhs plus crowd both Modi and Amit Shah had managed in their rallies at Kolkata in face of opposition from TMC.", "url": "https://x.com/sumoberoi/status/2110009109269696723"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110002611147649024"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T13:40:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110002853909774459"], "id": "2110002853909774459", "in_reply_to_user_id": "188335559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110002598472556998", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "দর্শনার্থীরা কলকাতা পুলিশের আওতাধীন সমস্ত থানা,ট্রাফিক গার্ড, হাওড়া ও শিয়ালদহ রেলওয়ে স্টেশন এবং কলকাতার সমস্ত মেট্রো স্টেশন থেকে এই গাইড ম্যাপ সংগ্রহ করতে পারবেন। এছাড়া আপনারা কলকাতা ট্রাফিক পুলিশের ওয়েবসাইট https://t.co/7asQbQI3Kt থেকে গাইডম্যাপের পিডিএফ ডাউনলোড করতে পারবেন https://t.co/nWbSNaJcS4", "url": "https://x.com/KPTrafficDept/status/2110002853909774459"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110002533234364416"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T13:39:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110002598472556998"], "id": "2110002598472556998", "in_reply_to_user_id": "188335559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110002396017705205", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "এই গাইড ম্যাপের সাহায্যে দর্শনার্থীরা পুজো পরিক্রমার পরিকল্পনা করতে পারবেন এবং কলকাতার বিভিন্ন গুরুত্বপূর্ণ পুজো মণ্ডপ খুঁজে পেতে সুবিধা হবে। https://t.co/JyMDpFtC9x", "url": "https://x.com/KPTrafficDept/status/2110002598472556998"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110002297384361984"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T13:39:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110002396017705205"], "id": "2110002396017705205", "in_reply_to_user_id": "188335559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110002286084882716", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "পুজোর ভিড়ে শহরের বিভিন্ন প্রান্তে প্রতিমা দর্শন, জনপ্রিয় পুজো মণ্ডপের অবস্থান চিহ্নিত করা এবং সহজে এক মণ্ডপ থেকে অন্য মণ্ডপে পৌঁছনোর ক্ষেত্রে দর্শনার্থীদের সহায়তা করাই এই বিশেষ উদ্যোগের মূল লক্ষ্য। https://t.co/ttkacK0ivy", "url": "https://x.com/KPTrafficDept/status/2110002396017705205"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110002175959343105"]}, "author_id": "188335559", "created_at": "2026-10-13T13:38:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110002286084882716"], "id": "2110002286084882716", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 795, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "আসন্ন দুর্গাপুজোয় দর্শনার্থীদের মণ্ডপ পরিদর্শন আরও সহজ ও সুশৃঙ্খল করে তুলতে প্রকাশ করা হল 'কলকাতা পুলিশের পুজো গাইড ম্যাপ ২০২৬’। https://t.co/BLCTbAQWhx", "url": "https://x.com/KPTrafficDept/status/2110002286084882716"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110000175515389952"]}, "author_id": "1096061918597574656", "created_at": "2026-10-13T13:30:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110000205630447800"], "id": "2110000205630447800", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1510203856130830336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109677333728907576", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CJP_for_India But why protest?\n\nCongress formed governments in so many States during the regime of the same CEO.\nAre they resigning from those?\n\nBy the wa